 "title": "Creamy Garlic One-Pot Pasta",
 "summary": "Pasta cooks right in a garlicky mushroom broth and finishes with cream cheese, parmesan and spinach. One pot, about 25 minutes.",
 "ingredients": [
  "1 tbsp olive oil",
  "8 oz mushrooms, sliced",
  "6 cloves garlic, minced",
  "1 lb rotini",
  "3 cups chicken broth",
  "1 cup milk",
  "1 tsp Italian seasoning",
  "½ tsp salt",
  "½ tsp black pepper",
  "4 oz cream cheese",
  "2 oz grated parmesan",
  "5 oz spinach",
  "1 lemon"
